\f0\b\fs56 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 TTD arxitekturasi qanday ishlaydi: ayniqsa API chaqiriqlari\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs28 \cf3 \strokec3 Ushbu hujjat loyiha ichidagi amaldagi qatlamli tuzilma asosida yozildi. Reponing o'zida 
\f0\b TTD
\f1\b0  degan alohida modul yoki papka topilmadi, lekin kod oqimi amalda 
\f0\b Presentation -> Domain -> Data
\f1\b0  ko'rinishida ishlayotgani sababli hujjat shu arxitektura asosida tushuntirildi.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \cb4 Hozirgi kod bazada to'liq ishlayotgan API oqimi asosan 
\f0\b getTasks()
\f1\b0  orqali tashkil qilingan. Ya'ni hozir asosiy misol sifatida 
\f0\b GET /api/tasks
\f1\b0  ishlatiladi.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs40 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 1. Qisqa mazmun\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs28 \cf3 \strokec3 Bu arxitekturada har bir qatlamning vazifasi aniq bo'linadi:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa120\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Presentation
\f1\b0  foydalanuvchi interfeysi va holatni boshqaradi.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Domain
\f1\b0  biznes mantiq va kontraktlarni belgilaydi.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Data
\f1\b0  API, server va tashqi manbalar bilan gaplashadi.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf3 \cb5 UI (TasksPage) -> Cubit (TasksCubit) -> UseCase (GetTaskUsecase) -> Repository (TaskRepository) -> DataSource (TaskRemoteDataSourceImpl) -> Dio -> API -> javob qaytadi -> UI state yangilanadi\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs40 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 2. Papkalar bo'yicha tuzilma\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa120\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\fs28 \cf3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 lib/features/tasks/presentation/
\f1\b0 : sahifa, widget va Cubit.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 lib/features/tasks/domain/
\f1\b0 : repository kontrakti va usecase.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 lib/features/tasks/data/
\f1\b0 : datasource va repository implementatsiyasi.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 lib/core/
\f1\b0 : umumiy xatoliklar, Either tipi, usecase bazasi va routing.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs40 \cf2 \strokec2 3. API chaqirig'i amalda qanday yuradi\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 3.1. Oqim qayerdan boshlanadi\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf3 \strokec3 TasksPage
\f1\b0  ochilganda u yerning o'zida kerakli objectlar zanjiri quriladi: 
\f3 TaskRemoteDataSourceImpl -> TaskRepositoryImple -> GetTaskUsecase -> TasksCubit
\f1 . So'ng darhol 
\f3 ..getTask()
\f1  chaqiriladi.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3 \cf3 \cb6 TasksCubit(\
  usecase: GetTaskUsecase(\
    taskRepository: TaskRepositoryImple(\
      dataSource: TaskRemoteDataSourceImpl(),\
    ),\
  ),\
)..getTask()\
  \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1 \cf3 \cb1 Bu yondashuvning ma'nosi shuki, UI API bilan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri gaplashmaydi. UI faqat Cubit bilan ishlaydi, qolgan qatlamlar pastga qarab uzatiladi.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf2 \strokec2 3.2. Cubit state boshqaradi\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf3 \strokec3 TasksCubit
\f1\b0  ichida 
\f3 getTask()
\f1  ishlaganda avval state 
\f3 loading
\f1  bo'ladi, keyin usecase chaqiriladi. Natija muvaffaqiyatli bo'lsa 
\f3 success
\f1 , xato bo'lsa 
\f3 error
\f1  holatiga o'tadi.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3 \cf3 \cb6 emit(state.copyWith(status: TaskStatus.loading));\
final result = await usecase.call(NoParams());\
\
if (result.isRight) \{\
  emit(state.copyWith(status: TaskStatus.success, data: result.right));\
\} else \{\
  emit(state.copyWith(\
    status: TaskStatus.error,\
    errorText: result.left.message,\
  ));\
\}\
  \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1 \cf3 \cb1 Hozirgi kodda foydalanuvchi loading holatini ko'rishi uchun sun'iy ravishda 
\f3 Future.delayed(Duration(seconds: 3))
\f1  ham qo'shilgan.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf2 \strokec2 3.3. UseCase biznes kirish nuqtasi bo'ladi\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf3 \strokec3 GetTaskUsecase
\f1\b0  domain qatlamida turadi va presentation qatlamini repository kontrakti bilan bog'laydi. U API qanday ishlashini bilmaydi, faqat 
\f3 taskRepository.getTasks()
\f1  ni chaqiradi.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf2 \strokec2 3.4. Repository abstraksiya beradi\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf3 \strokec3 TaskRepository
\f1\b0  domain kontrakt hisoblanadi. Bu qatlamning foydasi shundaki, Cubit yoki usecase API'ga bog'lanib qolmaydi. Ertaga API o'rniga local cache ishlatilsa ham, interfeys bir xil qoladi.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3 \cf3 \cb6 abstract class TaskRepository \{\
  Future<Either<Failure, List>> getTasks();\
\}\
  \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

